<h1>Check your inbox</h1>

<p>
  We have sent you an email with a confirmation link. Click it and you are on the
  list. If it does not arrive within a few minutes, check your spam folder — and if
  it is there, marking it as “not spam” helps the next one land properly.
</p>

<p>
  Nothing is sent to you until you confirm, and every email after that has a
  one-click unsubscribe link.
</p>

